Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
The cubic T-matrix from first principles \[LongDash] without Eshelby magic\
\>", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"f5725742-9bc6-4e6b-b1ca-6731f9063809"],

Cell["\<\
THE CUBIC T-MATRIX FROM FIRST PRINCIPLES --- WITHOUT ESHELBY MAGIC

   The usual route to a cube T-matrix quotes an \"Eshelby tensor\", adds a
   delta-function correction at r = 0 by hand, and assumes a uniform internal
   strain. All three are shortcuts. This notebook does none of them:

     * the static Green's tensor is written down and DIFFERENTIATED, not \
quoted;
     * the cell moment is converted to a SURFACE integral by the divergence
       theorem, which carries the r = 0 distributional term automatically ---
       there is no delta to add, and nothing to correct;
     * every geometric constant is INTEGRATED here, not taken from a table;
     * the one genuine approximation --- the affine (uniform-strain) internal
       field --- is stated explicitly, with the theorem that says exactly \
when
       it is exact.

   Scale: the cell moment of dd G is scale-free (dd G ~ 1/r^3, dV ~ a^3), so
   the half-width is set to 1 throughout without loss of generality.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"eb6ddcd0-eabb-4dc7-89ea-f7be73713d2f"],

Cell["\<\
Print[\"\"];
Print[\"THE CUBIC T-MATRIX FROM FIRST PRINCIPLES (no Eshelby shortcuts)\"];
Print[\"\"];\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e0f160ea-2b54-492c-bca3-b85c30dfa3f8"],

Cell["\<\
1.  THE STATIC GREEN'S TENSOR

   The static (Kelvin) tensor for an isotropic elastic solid is

       G_ij(r) = a0 delta_ij / r  +  b0 x_i x_j / r^3

   with a0 and b0 fixed by the Navier operator. Writing them through the wave
   speeds and then through the moduli:

       a0 = (1/8Pi)(1/mu + 1/(lam+2mu)),   b0 = (1/8Pi)(1/mu - 1/(lam+2mu)).

   These are not quoted from a table --- the check below confirms that this G
   satisfies the static Navier equation away from the origin.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8509b5d9-5364-4849-b1e0-73578b0b9a0b"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"a0", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", "/", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"8", " ", "Pi"}], ")"}]}], ")"}], " ", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"1", "/", "mu"}], " ", "+", " ", 
      RowBox[{"1", "/", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"lam", " ", "+", " ", 
         RowBox[{"2", " ", "mu"}]}], ")"}]}]}], ")"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"b0", " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"1", "/", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"8", " ", "Pi"}], ")"}]}], ")"}], " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"1", "/", "mu"}], " ", "-", " ", 
       RowBox[{"1", "/", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"lam", " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"2", " ", "mu"}]}], ")"}]}]}], ")"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"X", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"r", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"x", "^", "2"}], " ", "+", " ", 
     RowBox[{"y", "^", "2"}], " ", "+", " ", 
     RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"G", "[", 
     RowBox[{"i_", ",", " ", "j_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"a0", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"KroneckerDelta", "[", 
        RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "j"}], "]"}], "/", "r"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
     RowBox[{"b0", " ", 
      RowBox[{"X", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", "i", "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"X", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "j", "]"}], "]"}], "/", 
       RowBox[{"r", "^", "3"}]}]}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", "\n", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Navier", ":", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"mu", " ", "Lap", " ", "G_ij"}], " ", "+", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"lam", "+", "mu"}], ")"}], " ", "d_i", " ", "d_k", " ", 
       "G_kj"}]}]}], " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"0", "  ", "away", " ", "from", " ", "the", " ", 
     RowBox[{"origin", "."}]}]}], " ", "*)"}]}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"navier", "[", 
    RowBox[{"i_", ",", " ", "j_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", "\n", "   ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"mu", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Sum", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"D", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"G", "[", 
           RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "j"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"X", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "m", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"X", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "m", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"m", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], " ", "+", "\n", 
     "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"lam", " ", "+", " ", "mu"}], ")"}], " ", 
      RowBox[{"Sum", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"D", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"G", "[", 
           RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", "j"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"X", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "i", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"X", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "k", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<[1] Navier residual away from r=0 (must be 0): \>\"", ",", 
    "\n", "  ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"navier", "[", 
           RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "j"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"j", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Assumptions", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"r", " ", ">", " ", "0"}]}]}], "]"}], " ", "//", " ", 
      "Flatten"}], " ", "//", " ", "DeleteDuplicates"}]}], "]"}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",ExpressionUUID->"846b2633-147d-4ec0-a399-67ce738dc116"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{"\<\"[1] Navier residual away from r=0 (must be 0): \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]", 
   RowBox[{"{", "0", "}"}]}],
  SequenceForm["[1] Navier residual away from r=0 (must be 0): ", {0}],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9984425325162897`*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[1]:=",ExpressionUUID->"4d000307-1467-43d5-8133-32210a34db20"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
2.  THE CELL MOMENT, BY THE DIVERGENCE THEOREM --- THIS IS THE \"NO MAGIC\" \
STEP

   The object the single-site theory needs is

       I_{ijkl} = Int_cell  d_i d_j G_kl  dV .

   Its integrand goes as 1/r^3, which is NOT absolutely integrable in three
   dimensions: the naive volume quadrature is meaningless, and the standard fix
   is to bolt on a delta-function term \"by Eshelby\". That is unnecessary. The
   DISTRIBUTIONAL derivative satisfies the divergence theorem exactly, so

       Int_cell d_i (d_j G_kl) dV  =  Int_{boundary} n_i (d_j G_kl) dA ,

   and the surface integrand is bounded on the faces (the origin is interior,
   at distance a from every face). The r = 0 content is carried across
   automatically. No principal value, no delta, no correction.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d118d523-c7ac-4857-89e4-ec587e2a5788"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"a", " ", "=", " ", "1"}], ";"}], "  ", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"half", "-", "width"}], ";", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"the", " ", "moment", " ", "is", " ", "scale"}], "-", "free"}]}],
    " ", "*)"}], "\n", "\n", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"face", " ", 
     RowBox[{"integral", ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "the", " ", "two", " ", "faces", " ", "normal", " ", "to", " ", "axis", 
       " ", "m", " ", "contribute", " ", "n_i"}]}]}], " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"+", 
      RowBox[{"-", "delta_"}]}], 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"i", ",", "m"}], "}"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}]}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"faceMoment", "[", 
     RowBox[{"i_", ",", " ", "j_", ",", " ", "k_", ",", " ", "l_"}], "]"}], 
    " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
       "f", ",", " ", "sp", ",", " ", "sm", ",", " ", "ax", ",", " ", "o1", ",",
         " ", "o2"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"f", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"D", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"G", "[", 
           RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", "l"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"X", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "j", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"ax", " ", "=", " ", "i"}], ";", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"o1", ",", " ", "o2"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Complement", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", "ax", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"sp", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"f", " ", "/.", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"X", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "ax", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "a"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"X", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "o1", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "u"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"X", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "o2", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "v"}]}], 
          "}"}]}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"sm", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"f", " ", "/.", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"X", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "ax", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", 
            RowBox[{"-", "a"}]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"X", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "o1", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "u"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"X", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "o2", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "v"}]}], 
          "}"}]}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"Integrate", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"sp", " ", "-", " ", "sm"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"u", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"-", "a"}], ",", " ", "a"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"v", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"-", "a"}], ",", " ", "a"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
   ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
  "Print", "[", "\"\<[2] evaluating the three independent surface moments ...\
\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"I0000", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
    RowBox[{"faceMoment", "[", 
     RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"I0011", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
    RowBox[{"faceMoment", "[", 
     RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"I0101", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
    RowBox[{"faceMoment", "[", 
     RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<    I_1111 = \>\"", ",", " ", "I0000"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<    I_1122 = \>\"", ",", " ", "I0011"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<    I_1212 = \>\"", ",", " ", "I0101"}], "]"}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[8]:=",ExpressionUUID->"c55e339b-7d60-41a7-b2d8-419460e62e2b"],

